  "steps": [
    "Halve the squash, peel it and scoop out the seeds. Pre-bake at 180 °C for 10–12 minutes to soften slightly.",
    "Lay a wooden spoon or chopstick along each side and cut thin slices, stopping before you cut all the way through.",
    "Mix the olive oil with the spices, brush it all over and roast at 200 °C for 50–60 minutes until tender.",
    "Blend the ricotta ingredients for 2–3 minutes until silky. If it's grainy, add water or oil a tablespoon at a time, and season well.",
    "Swirl the ricotta over a plate, set the squash on top and finish with pecans and a drizzle of olive oil."
  ]
